  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Zerkall papers, attached and folded into a hybrid codex/accordion structure, attached at either end to blue-cloth-covered boards with letterpress-printed paper title label inset on front. Illustrations and text printed using a variety of relief techniques. Techniques include pressure printing into shaped vinyl relief plates (used for letterpress printing) and letterpress printed handset type and printer's ornaments. Ornaments cast by Skyline Type Foundry. Text is Trump Mediaeval.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The text came from a piece of writing made while on sabbatical in Leipzig, Germany in 2009, pondering the inability to silence painful thoughts connected to my life in Portland, 5235 miles away. The images came out of a different motivation: a desire to create a private visual space to calm my nerves during the stressful political campaigns. These two seemingly separate emotional investigations decided to come together in this book"--Artist's statement, Vamp &amp; Tramp Booksellers' website, September 19, 2017.</subfield>
    <subfield code="u">http://www.vampandtramp.com/finepress/t/triangular.html.</subfield>
  </datafield>
